      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Notes on agent run:\n1. Agent only allow to read the contract file, and write the answer\n    No external skills, web search, code execution is NOT allowed\n    No memory\n2. Agent run in a \"docker container\" -- an isolated environment from personal device\n\n\nLLM API call experiment: ~$50\nAgent experiment: using subscription, no real charge but equivalent to ~$100",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Notes on agent run:\n1. Agent only allow to read the contract file, and write the answer\n    No external skills, web search, code execution is NOT allowed\n    No memory\n2. Agent run in a \"docker container\" -- an isolated environment from personal device\n\n\nLLM API call experiment: ~$50\nAgent experiment: using subscription, no real charge but equivalent to ~$100",
